# GEMINI_API_KEY: Required for live Gemini AI calls (RAG notes, diagrams,
# formula extraction, doubt solving, flashcards, classification).
# If omitted, Tattva gracefully falls back to its built-in offline engineering
# knowledge base so the app stays fully functional.
#
# Configure this via your deployment platform's secrets panel
# (Vercel Environment Variables / AI Studio Secrets / Docker env), NOT in a
# committed file. A local `.env` file is also supported during development.
GEMINI_API_KEY=""